00:29:43,086 --> 00:29:51,844
当时发生的情况是，阿丽亚娜5号重用了阿丽亚娜4号的一部分软件。
And what happened there was that Ariane 5 reused part of the software from Ariane 4.

240
00:29:52,224 --> 00:29:56,784
然而阿丽亚娜4号的行为略有不同。
And then the behavior of Ariane 4 is slightly different.

241
00:29:56,878 --> 00:30:04,900
然后有一个叫水平偏差的变量，基本上发生了溢出。
And then there was a variable called horizontal bias, was basically overflow.

