One, why was it not checked?

245
00:30:20,624 --> 00:30:23,844
在那个时候，这并不是完全是软件的问题。
Back then, and that's not completely software issue.

246
00:30:29,264 --> 00:30:36,304
但要求是只能使用该处理器 80% 的 CPU 资源。
But the requirement was to use only 80% of that of the CPU on that processor.

247
00:30:36,558 --> 00:30:48,932
而且在当时使用的 ADA 语言中，无法对系统中所有变量都进行溢出检查，
因为这基本上会增加 CPU 负载。
And it was not possible in the ADA language which was used back then to have the overflow checked on all the variables which were in
the system because that basically increases the CPU load.

248
00:30:50,624 --> 00:30:55,780
所以只检查了四个变量，其中三个被分析为没问题。
So four of the variables were checked, three of them were analyzed to be okay.

249
00:30:56,110 --> 00:30:59,684
而这一个虽然被分析过了，但是在阿丽亚娜4号上，而不是阿丽亚娜5号上。
And this one was analyzed but on Ariane 4, not on Ariane 5.

250
00:31:00,334 --> 00:31:04,784
另一件事是，出故障的软件实际上并没有被使用。
The other thing is that the software which failed was actually not used.

