00:31:57,344 --> 00:32:12,868
你应该如何重用这类软件，比如通过一系列前置条件、后置
条件，或者某种形式的约束规范化，来决定如何使用该软件。
How you should reuse that kind of software, you know, like with some sort of set of preconditions, postconditions,
some way of formalizing the constraints, how you can use that software.

254
00:32:13,198 --> 00:32:14,372
而这些都没有做到。
And this was not done.

255
00:32:14,798 --> 00:32:19,824
如果基础模块设计契约被记录并经过检查，这次故障就不会发生。
The failure would not have happened if the building block design contract was documented and checked.

