为了测试所有现实场景，要使用端到端模拟，进行故障注入、鲁棒性与压力测试，就是这些内容。
To test all realistic scenarios, use end-to-end simulation, uh, do uh
fault injection, robustness and stress testing, uh, this kind of stuff.

